<article class="acw-page" data-ac-page-section="public-about" data-ac-acw-screen="ACW06">
  <section class="acw-hero">
    <div>
      <p class="acw-kicker">About ActiveClinic</p>
      <h1>Precision technology. Human connection.</h1>
      <p class="acw-hero__lede">ActiveClinic is a healthcare operations platform for clinics and hospitals. It is part of the GetPro product family, with a pilot focus on organisations in Zambia.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="acw-hero__media">
      <%- include('../partials/ac-media', {
        src: '/activeclinic/assets/platform/home-hero.jpg',
        alt: '',
        decorative: true,
        className: 'acp-hero__image',
        objectFit: 'cover',
        objectPosition: 'center 30%',
        aspect: '16 / 10',
        width: 960,
        height: 600,
        loading: 'lazy',
      }) %>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="acw-section" data-ac-about-section="mission">
    <header class="acw-section-header">
      <h2>Why ActiveClinic exists</h2>
    </header>
    <div class="acw-grid acw-grid--2">
      <article class="acw-card">
        <h3>Access for patients</h3>
        <p>Help people find clinics that choose to publish, without exposing anyone’s medical record.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="acw-card">
        <h3>Tools for local clinics</h3>
        <p>Give enrolled teams a secure app for patients, appointments, and a website they control.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="acw-section acw-section--band" data-ac-about-section="principles">
    <div class="acw-section__inner">
      <header class="acw-section-header">
        <h2>Our core principles</h2>
      </header>
      <div class="acw-grid acw-grid--3">
        <article class="acw-card">
          <h3>Trust</h3>
          <p>Clinical work stays in the authenticated application. Public pages show only published content.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="acw-card">
          <h3>Privacy</h3>
          <p>Organisation data is isolated per clinic. We do not display charts, results, or billing on marketing pages.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="acw-card">
          <h3>Reliability</h3>
          <p>Phone formats, provinces, and timezone defaults are designed for Zambian healthcare organisations.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="acw-section" data-ac-about-section="capabilities">
    <h2>Capability status</h2>
    <p class="ac-public-note">We label features honestly. <strong>Available</strong> means live for enrolled organisations. <strong>Pilot</strong> means limited rollout. <strong>Planned</strong> means on the roadmap — not offered as a guarantee today.</p>
    <div class="ac-capability-grid">
      <article class="ac-capability-card">
        <span class="ac-capability-badge ac-capability-badge--available">Available</span>
        <h3>Clinic directory</h3>
        <p>Search published clinics by name, location, or listed services.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ac-capability-card">
        <span class="ac-capability-badge ac-capability-badge--available">Available</span>
        <h3>Staff operations app</h3>
        <p>Authenticated workspace for reception, appointments, and organisation administration.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ac-capability-card">
        <span class="ac-capability-badge ac-capability-badge--available">Available</span>
        <h3>Public tenant websites</h3>
        <p>Per-clinic pages for services, doctors, contact, and policies when published.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ac-capability-card">
        <span class="ac-capability-badge ac-capability-badge--available">Available</span>
        <h3>Appointment requests</h3>
        <p>Patients submit requests; clinics confirm — not instant booking guarantees.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ac-capability-card">
        <span class="ac-capability-badge ac-capability-badge--pilot">Pilot</span>
        <h3>Booking status lookup</h3>
        <p>Patients with a booking link can view status and request changes where enabled.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ac-capability-card">
        <span class="ac-capability-badge ac-capability-badge--pilot">Pilot</span>
        <h3>Patient portal</h3>
        <p>Clinic-scoped patient accounts for bookings where a clinic enables them.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ac-capability-card">
        <span class="ac-capability-badge ac-capability-badge--planned">Planned</span>
        <h3>Automated notifications</h3>
        <p>SMS or email confirmations when delivery infrastructure is in place — not promised today.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ac-capability-card">
        <span class="ac-capability-badge ac-capability-badge--planned">Planned</span>
        <h3>Live slot calendars</h3>
        <p>Real-time availability requires clinic-configured schedules — not a platform-wide guarantee.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="acw-section" data-ac-about-section="getpro">
    <h2>Part of GetPro</h2>
    <p>ActiveClinic shares platform foundations with other GetPro products while keeping its own clinical workflows, design system, and public website.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="acw-cta-band">
    <div class="acw-cta-band__inner">
      <h2>Questions about joining?</h2>
      <p class="ac-public-actions">
        <a class="ac-btn ac-btn--primary" href="/register-clinic">Register Your Clinic</a>
        <a class="ac-btn ac-btn--secondary" href="/contact">Contact ActiveClinic</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</article>
